From 3e50e4b0bb7330772c1c5c7f62ee12ee794cf6fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Furyogen <fury@worldofclaudecraft.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:48:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(render): opt-in first-person camera at the closest
 zoom

A new Interface option, firstPersonMode, puts the camera at the
player's eyes when zoomed all the way in: Show Body hides only the head
(its hair, face and helm collapse with the head bone) and No Body hides
the whole model. Off is the default and keeps the chase camera exactly.
The camera's audio-listener block moved to camera_audio_listener.ts to
pay for the hook, and the renderer ceiling comes down with it.
